	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(20.0, 20.0, 470.0, 96.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="13">PRAKTIKUM 1 — Foundations

Widgets communicate over CHANNELS. Double-click a link to see which channel it uses.
Start at File, then follow the arrows. Every widget updates the moment its input changes.</text>
		<text id="1" type="text/plain" rect="(440.0, 110.0, 330.0, 128.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="13">WHAT TO DO
1. Open Data Table. How many rows and columns?
2. Open Feature Statistics. Which column has the most
   missing values? Which are identifiers?
3. Open Distributions and set the variable to 'default'.
   What is the base rate? Remember it for week 7.</text>
	</annotations>
